      "id": "7550a3c8ff42-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "Find the least fraction of the following. &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2348;&#2360;&#2375; &#2331;&#2379;&#2335;&#2366; &#2309;&#2306;&#2358; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Find the least fraction of the following.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2348;&#2360;&#2375; &#2331;&#2379;&#2335;&#2366; &#2309;&#2306;&#2358; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "2/5 2/5",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">2/5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2/5</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "4/7 4/7",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">4/7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4/7</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "1/4 1/4",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1/4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/4</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "1/11 1/11",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1/11</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/11</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>2/5 = 0.4 ; 4/7 = 0.57 ; 1/4 = 0.25 ; 1/11 = 0.09</p><p>Clearly, 1/11 is the least.</p>",
