      "id": "7550a3c8ff42-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "Which of the following is true? I: 18/43 > 12/31 > 17/35 II: 7/18 < 9/21 < 11/24 &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;? I: 18/43 > 12/31 > 17/35 II: 7/18 < 9/21 < 11/24",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which of the following is true?</p><p>I: 18/43 &gt; 12/31 &gt; 17/35</p><p>II: 7/18 &lt; 9/21 &lt; 11/24</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p>I: 18/43 &gt; 12/31 &gt; 17/35</p><p>II: 7/18 &lt; 9/21 &lt; 11/24</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Only I &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Only I</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
