      "id": "7550a3c8ff42-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "Which fraction bears the same ratio to 1/20 as 5/6 does to 7/12? &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; 1/20 &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2361;&#2368; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2379; 5/6 &#2325;&#2366; 7/12 &#2360;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which fraction bears the same ratio to 1/20 as 5/6 does to 7/12? </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; 1/20 &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2361;&#2368; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2379; 5/6 &#2325;&#2366; 7/12 &#2360;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1/14 1/14",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1/14</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/14</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "3/17 3/17",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">3/17</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3/17</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "1/21 1/21",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1/21</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/21</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "2/35 2/35",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">2/35</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2/35</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>Required fraction = 5/6 * 12/7 * 1/20 = 1/14</p>",
