          "text": "7/20, 9/28, 11/36 7/20, 9/28, 11/36",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">7/20, 9/28, 11/36</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">7/20, 9/28, 11/36</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "11/36, 7/20, 9/28 11/36, 7/20, 9/28",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">11/36, 7/20, 9/28</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">11/36, 7/20, 9/28</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "7/20, 11/36, 9/28 7/20, 11/36, 9/28",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">7/20, 11/36, 9/28</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">7/20, 11/36, 9/28</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>L.C.M = 20, 36, and 28 = 1260</p><p>7/20 = 441/1260</p><p>11/36 = 385/1260</p><p>9/28 = 405/1260</p><p>Descending = 7/20, 9/28, 11/36</p>",
