    {
      "id": "7550a3c8ff42-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "A fraction is 3/4 less than another fraction. If the sum of the fractions is 9/10, then find the smaller fraction. &#2319;&#2325; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2368; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375; 3/4 &#2325;&#2350; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327; 9/10 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2331;&#2379;&#2335;&#2368; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>A fraction is 3/4 less than another fraction. If the sum of the fractions is 9/10, then find the smaller fraction.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2368; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375; 3/4 &#2325;&#2350; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327; 9/10 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2331;&#2379;&#2335;&#2368; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "3/20 3/20",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">3/20</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3/20</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1/10 1/10",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1/10</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/10</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "3/40 3/40",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">3/40</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3/40</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "3/8 3/8",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">3/8</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3/8</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Let smaller fraction = x</p><p>Larger fraction = x + 3/4</p><p>Now,</p><p>x + x + 3/4 = 9/10</p><p>2x = 9/10  -  3/4 = 3/20</p><p>x = 3/40</p><p>Hence, smaller fraction = 3/40</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
