      "id": "7550a3c8ff42-q12",
      "number": 12,
      "question": "What are the largest fractions of 5/12, 7/24, 9/16, and 11/18 5/12, 7/24, 9/16 &#2324;&#2352; 11/18 &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2348;&#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2337;&#2364;&#2375; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What are the largest fractions of 5/12, 7/24, 9/16, and 11/18</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>5/12, 7/24, 9/16 &#2324;&#2352; 11/18 &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2348;&#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2337;&#2364;&#2375; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "96/144 96/144",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">96/144</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">96/144</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "92/144 92/144",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">92/144</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">92/144</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "86/144 86/144",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">86/144</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">86/144</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "88/144 88/144",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">88/144</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">88/144</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>L.C.M of 12, 24, 16, and 18 = 144</p><p>5/12 = 60/144</p><p>7/24 = 42/144</p><p>9/16 = 81/144</p><p>11/18 = 88/144</p><p>Hence, the required number is 88/144.</p>",
