      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Let X = 7.6<img width=12 height=20 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p6668/image007.png\"> = 7.62222...(i)</p><p>Then, 100X = 762.222....(ii)</p><p>On subtracting (i) by (ii), we get</p><p>99X = 754.6</p><p>X = 3773/495 = <b>7(308/495)</b></p><p></p><p><b>Express Method </b></p><p>7.6<img width=12 height=20 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p6668/image007.png\"> = (7622 - 76)/990 = 7546/990</p><p>= 7(308/495)</p><p></p>",
